  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Whether to run leg IK or play animation seems to be based on whether the analog stick/trackpad is pushed, rather than movement speed or whether the player is in the air. This is most noticeable in SDK3 worlds with the new character controller, as aerial momentum isn't lost when the analog stick is released, so you will continue to move in a direction while IK frantically moves your legs to keep up.\nIK in the air is probably desirable behaviour for full-body, so special exception could be applied in those cases.",
